# Milestone 1 — System Diagrams (Mermaid)

## 1) Overall System Architecture

```mermaid
flowchart TB
  U[User] --> R[React UI]
  R --> SB[Spring Boot Backend]
  SB --> SUB[Code Submission Module]
  SB --> AI[AI Gateway]
  SUB --> MP[Multi-Agent Pipeline]
  MP --> A1[Code Analysis Agent]
  MP --> A2[Security Agent]
  MP --> A3[Remediation Agent]
  MP --> A4[PR Summary Agent]
  AI --> KB[RAG Knowledge Base]
  KB --> O[Ollama (LLM)]
  O --> REP[Review Report]
```

## 2) Agent Workflow

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  S[Submitted Code] --> L[Language Detection + Syntax Checks]
  L --> C[Code Smell Review]
  C --> SEC[OWASP Mapping (SQLi/XSS/CSRF/Broken Access/Secrets)]
  SEC --> REM[Remediation Agent (secure fixes)]
  REM --> PR[PR Summary Agent (risk + changes)]
  PR --> OUT[Final Review Report]
```

## 3) Data Flow

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  P[Paste/Upload Code] --> V[Spring Boot Validation]
  V --> STORE[Store source in uploads/]
  STORE --> REQ[POST /api/review]
  REQ --> FASTAPI[FastAPI AI Service]
  FASTAPI --> RET[Retrieve relevant chunks]
  RET --> RAGCTX[Context for LLM]
  RAGCTX --> OLLAMA[Ollama generate]
  OLLAMA --> RESP[AI review response]
  RESP --> UI[React/Result page]
```

## 4) Knowledge Base / Vector Store Design

```mermaid
flowchart TD
  D1[Docs: OWASP Top 10] --> CH[Chunking]
  D2[Docs: Secure Coding] --> CH
  D3[Docs: Java/Python Rules] --> CH
  CH[Text chunks] --> EMB[Embeddings]
  EMB --> VDB[(Vector DB / vector-store.json)]
  Q[User question/code] --> RET[Retriever]
  RET --> VDB
  RET --> CTX[Top-k chunks]
  CTX --> LLM[Ollama prompt]
```

